* Speak to {n:Akta} - {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (H-10) to choose your fellow's height: short, medium, or tall.
* Speak to {n:Kuah Dakonsa} - {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-8) who will ask you to choose your fellow's face and hair.
